OL,3,APhase Eight and Hobbs owner hit by
OL,4,Acyber-attack, as H&M probes separate
OL,5,Ahack claim
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe owner of high-end fashion brands
OL,8,FHobbs, Whistles and Phase Eight says it
OL,9,Fis investigating a cyber-security
OL,10,Fincident.
OL,12,FAccording to TFG London - the UK arm of
OL,13,Fretail conglomerate The Foschini Group
OL,14,F- it identified an incident on Sunday
OL,15,Faffecting some IT systems and
OL,16,F"specifically impacting our Phase
OL,17,FEight, Hobbs, and Whistles brands".
OL,19,F"We are actively investigating and
OL,20,Fworking with external cyber security
OL,21,Fspecialists," the company told BBC News
OL,22,Fin a statement.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
