OL,3,ARaye hits back at ticket touts who
OL,4,A'overwhelmed' sign-up for Albert Hall
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FRaye has hit back at ticket touts who
OL,8,Fshe says "overwhelmed" the sign-up
OL,9,Fprocess for an upcoming live show by
OL,10,Fusing AI bots to create "hundreds of
OL,11,Fthousands of fake registrations".
OL,13,FThe Where Is My Husband! singer
OL,14,Frevealed there were 1.8 million
OL,15,Fsign-ups for her one-off 5,000-seat
OL,16,Fperformance at the Royal Albert Hall on
OL,17,F23 October.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
